## Summary

- What changed and why?
- Which spec section/addendum records the decision?

## Validation

- [ ] Typecheck
- [ ] Lint and format
- [ ] Unit tests with coverage
- [ ] WXT production build
- [ ] Fixture-backed E2E (or explicit recon-fixture caveat)
- [ ] No `.auth/`, raw captures, tokens, user IDs, phone numbers, or addresses
- [ ] Live smoke only when explicitly needed and capped at five

## Risk and rollback

Describe PDD layout assumptions, permission changes, and the simplest rollback.
